-- 20 T-Series Films titles (see README "T-Series catalog"). Metadata only: the full films are NOT
-- included. poster_url points at the TMDB image CDN (local SVG fallback is /api/posters/<id>.svg);
-- trailer_youtube_id is the official trailer on the T-Series YouTube channel (embedded, not hosted).
-- video_path is a short Blender open-movie sample clip (CC BY 3.0) used as the prototype preview (ids 7–20 reuse the six clips).
-- Prices in paise (14900 = ₹149). rating = TMDB user score out of 10 (checked 2026-10-08).
